    <p class="rsnote" style="margin-top:6px">Full player shows the video and all controls; slim bar shows only play/pause, the progress bar and mute (uploaded videos keep playing as sound only). YouTube and Spotify keep their own player visible. Shortcut: <kbd>V</kbd>.</p>
  </div>
  <p class="rsnote">Applies to the portal, HTML handouts and post-tests. PDFs and images keep their own layout — use the + and − zoom buttons there.</p>
