    return t;
  }

  // ---------- the lesson's template, not only its colours: fonts, kickers, masthead, cards, chips, notes, buttons, cover ----------
  // thKit reads the design of the handout or lecture deck (its own classes when it has them — .kicker, .mast, .panel, .mini, .cnum,
  // .keys, .clinical, the cover and the top bar — else the same roles found by their look) and returns CSS values that a skin
