      if (/gradient/.test(cv.backgroundImage)) layers = cv.backgroundImage.split(/,(?![^(]*\))(?![^(]*\([^)]*\))/).map(function(x){ return x.trim(); }).filter(function(x){ return /^(linear|radial|conic|repeating)-gradient/.test(x); });
      var cbg2 = solid(cv.backgroundColor) || c.head;
      K.hero = (layers.length ? layers.join(", ") + ", " : "") + thStr(cbg2);
      var hk = scan(cov, null, upper); if (hk){ var hkc = solid(cs(hk).color); if (hkc) K["hero-k"] = thStr(hkc); }
      var hh = cov.querySelector("h1,h2"); if (hh){ K["hero-fg"] = thStr(solid(cs(hh).color) || [255, 255, 255, 1]); var em = hh.querySelector("em,i"); if (em) K["hero-em"] = thStr(solid(cs(em).color) || [255, 255, 255, 1]); }
      var hp = cov.querySelector("p"); if (hp) K["hero-p"] = thStr(solid(cs(hp).color) || [255, 255, 255, 1]);
      var hb = first([".go", ".cta a", "a.btn", ".btn", "button", "a[class*=start]", "[class*=start]", "a[href]"], null, function(el, st){ return cov.contains(el) && !!solid(st.backgroundColor); });
      if (hb){ var hbs = cs(hb); K["hb-bg"] = thStr(solid(hbs.backgroundColor)); K["hb-fg"] = thStr(solid(hbs.color) || thOn(solid(hbs.backgroundColor))); K["hb-rad"] = hbs.borderTopLeftRadius; K["hb-w"] = hbs.fontWeight; if (hbs.boxShadow !== "none") K["hb-sh"] = hbs.boxShadow; }
    }
    // quiz typography: the question stem, answer options (and their letter), the rationale; small section headings
    var cl2 = function(v, lo, hi){ return Math.max(lo, Math.min(hi, px(v))) + "px"; };
    var stem = first([".stem", ".question", ".q-stem", ".qtext", "[class*=stem]"], avoid);
    if (stem){ var sts = cs(stem); K["q-f"] = sts.fontFamily; K["q-w"] = sts.fontWeight; K["q-fs"] = cl2(sts.fontSize, 16.5, 19); }
    var opt = first([".opt", ".option", ".choice", "[class*=option]", "[class*=choice]"], avoid);
    if (opt){ var os = cs(opt); K["o-f"] = os.fontFamily; K["o-fs"] = cl2(os.fontSize, 13.5, 16); var ob = solid(os.backgroundColor); if (ob) K["o-bg"] = thStr(ob);
      if (px(os.borderTopWidth)) K["o-bd"] = os.borderTopWidth + " solid " + thStr(solid(os.borderTopColor) || c.text); K["o-rad"] = os.borderTopLeftRadius; }
    var why = first([".why", ".rationale", ".explain", ".explanation", ".feedback", "[class*=rationale]"], avoid);
    if (why){ var ws = cs(why); K["w-f"] = ws.fontFamily; K["w-fs"] = cl2(ws.fontSize, 13.5, 16); var wb = solid(ws.backgroundColor); if (wb) K["w-bg"] = thStr(wb);
      K["w-l"] = px(ws.borderLeftWidth) >= 2 && solid(ws.borderLeftColor) ? ws.borderLeftWidth + " solid " + thStr(solid(ws.borderLeftColor)) : "0 solid transparent"; K["w-rad"] = ws.borderTopLeftRadius; }
    var h4 = first(["h4", "h5"], avoid, function(el, st){ return st.textTransform === "uppercase" || st.fontFamily !== hs.fontFamily; });
    if (h4){ var h4s = cs(h4); K["h4-f"] = h4s.fontFamily; K["h4-fs"] = cl2(h4s.fontSize, 12, 15); K["h4-ls"] = h4s.letterSpacing; K["h4-tt"] = h4s.textTransform; K["h4-w"] = h4s.fontWeight; var h4c = solid(h4s.color); if (h4c) K["h4-c"] = thStr(h4c); }
    if (cov){ var ch1 = cov.querySelector("h1,h2"); if (ch1){ var c1s = cs(ch1); K["hero-f"] = c1s.fontFamily; K["hero-w"] = c1s.fontWeight; K["hero-ls"] = c1s.letterSpacing; }
      var lede = cov.querySelector(".lede,.sub,.subtitle,p"); if (lede){ var ls2 = cs(lede); K["lede-f"] = ls2.fontFamily; K["lede-st"] = ls2.fontStyle; } }
    // a page pattern (doodles) when it is drawn by the page itself
    var pimg = cs(doc.body).backgroundImage; if (pimg && pimg !== "none" && pimg.length < 200000 && !/url\(\s*["']?(?!data:)/i.test(pimg)) K["paper-img"] = pimg;
